{"seq":1,"slug":"ubo-25pct-ownership-layering","title":"UBO 25% 穿透与控权人识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/ubo-controller-due-diligence/ubo-25pct-ownership-layering","wordCount":2277,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"ubo-25-穿透与控权人识别\">UBO 25% 穿透与控权人识别</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>受益所有人（Ultimate Beneficial Owner, UBO）</strong> 指最终拥有或控制某个法人实体的<strong>自然人</strong>。这个定义里有三个词都要咬住：<strong>最终</strong>（不能停在中间层公司）、<strong>拥有或控制</strong>（股权与控权两条路径）、<strong>自然人</strong>（结论必须是活人，不能落在另一家公司上）。</p>\n<p>25% 这个数字来自反洗钱标准的通行实践，但它<strong>不是唯一阈值、也不是唯一路径</strong>。各国在采纳时的措辞并不一致：英国 Companies House 的&quot;重要控制人&quot;（PSC）条件的表述是持有<strong>超过 25%</strong> 的股份或表决权；加拿大的测试表述是<strong>至少 25%</strong> 的表决权或已发行股份的公允市场价值，并同时涵盖&quot;足以构成实际控制的影响力&quot;；阿联酋的表述是持有 25% 的所有权与表决权，外加任命或罢免董事的权力（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beneficial_ownership\">Beneficial ownership</a>）。欧盟的第四号反洗钱指令要求建立受益所有权信息并在 2017 年 6 月前完成转化，其框架本身也是&quot;所有权或控制&quot;并列表述。法规层面的共通结构是：<strong>一个数值阈值 + 一组定性的控制兜底条件</strong>。</p>\n<p>工程上，穿透是<strong>在有向图上做递归权益求和</strong>。节点是法人或自然人，边是持股关系，边权是持股比例。UBO 判定就是：从被尽调的主体出发，沿边向上遍历，找到所有终点为自然人且累计权益达到阈值的路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[目标公司 Target] --&gt;|60%| B[中间控股 Co-A]&#10;  A --&gt;|15%| C[中间控股 Co-B]&#10;  B --&gt;|90%| D((自然人 P1))&#10;  B --&gt;|10%| E((自然人 P2))&#10;  C --&gt;|100%| F[信托结构 Co-C]&#10;  F --&gt;|70%| G((自然人 P3))&#10;  F --&gt;|0% 表决权 100%| H((自然人 P4 受托控制))&#10;  D --&gt; I[P1 累计 = 60%*90% = 54%]&#10;  E --&gt; J[P2 累计 = 60%*10% = 6%]&#10;  G --&gt; K[P3 累计 = 15%*100%*70% = 10.5%]&#10;  H --&gt; L[控权路径: 不足阈值但控制]\">graph TD\n  A[目标公司 Target] --&gt;|60%| B[中间控股 Co-A]\n  A --&gt;|15%| C[中间控股 Co-B]\n  B --&gt;|90%| D((自然人 P1))\n  B --&gt;|10%| E((自然人 P2))\n  C --&gt;|100%| F[信托结构 Co-C]\n  F --&gt;|70%| G((自然人 P3))\n  F --&gt;|0% 表决权 100%| H((自然人 P4 受托控制))\n  D --&gt; I[P1 累计 = 60%*90% = 54%]\n  E --&gt; J[P2 累计 = 60%*10% = 6%]\n  G --&gt; K[P3 累计 = 15%*100%*70% = 10.5%]\n  H --&gt; L[控权路径: 不足阈值但控制]</pre><h2 id=\"权益的递归计算\">权益的递归计算</h2><h3 id=\"乘法沿路径-加法跨路径\">乘法沿路径、加法跨路径</h3><p>累计权益的算法是：<strong>沿一条路径把各段比例相乘，把同一自然人在所有路径上的结果相加</strong>。上图中 P1 的累计权益是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.60</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.90</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.54</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.60 \\times 0.90 = 0.54</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.90</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.54</span></span></span></span></span>，即 54%，超过 25% 阈值，是 UBO。P2 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.60</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.06</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.60 \\times 0.10 = 0.06</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.06</span></span></span></span></span>，6%，不达阈值。P3 经过两层中间结构是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.00</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.70</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.105</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15 \\times 1.00 \\times 0.70 = 0.105</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.00</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.70</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.105</span></span></span></span></span>，10.5%，同样不达阈值。</p>\n<p>这里最常见的实现错误是<strong>逐层取最大值而不是求和</strong>。如果系统在每一层只保留最大的股东，那么一个自然人通过三条各 10% 的路径合计持有 30% 的情形会被判为&quot;不达阈值&quot;。要抓住这一点，图的遍历必须以<strong>路径</strong>为单位而不是以<strong>层</strong>为单位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"环形持股与截断\">环形持股与截断</h3><p>持股结构里可以有环：A 持有 B、B 持有 C、C 又持有 A。这在真实商业结构里不罕见（交叉持股的集团）。递归遍历必须有<strong>访问标记</strong>，遇到已访问节点就停止该路径的延伸——否则算法不终止。环形结构本身也是一个应当落档的信号，因为它让&quot;最终权益&quot;在数学上不再有唯一的路径分解。</p>\n<p>另一类需要截断的情况是<strong>层级上限</strong>。监管实践通常要求穿透到最终自然人，但工程上必须设一个深度上限（例如 10 层）作为熔断，超过上限的走人工。设上限的目的不是放过深层结构，而是让&quot;穿不到底&quot;变成一个<strong>显式失败</strong>而不是静默返回空集合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def resolve_ubo(root_key, edges, threshold=0.25, max_depth=10):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;edges: {holder_key: [(subject_key, ratio), ...]}  持有者 -&gt; 被持有者&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    results, flags = {}, []&#10;    stack = [(root_key, 1.0, [root_key])]&#10;    while stack:&#10;        node, acc, path = stack.pop()&#10;        if len(path) &gt; max_depth:&#10;            flags.append((&quot;depth_exceeded&quot;, path))&#10;            continue&#10;        holders = edges.get(node, [])&#10;        if not holders:                       # 无上层股东 =&gt; 自然人终点&#10;            if node.startswith(&quot;person:&quot;):&#10;                results[node] = results.get(node, 0.0) + acc&#10;            continue&#10;        for holder, ratio in holders:&#10;            if holder in path:                # 环形持股&#10;                flags.append((&quot;cycle&quot;, path + [holder]))&#10;                continue&#10;            stack.append((holder, acc * ratio, path + [holder]))&#10;    ubos = {p: w for p, w in results.items() if w &gt;= threshold}&#10;    return ubos, results, flags\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve_ubo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root_key, edges, threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, max_depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"edges: {holder_key: [(subject_key, ratio), ...]}  持有者 -> 被持有者\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results, flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}, []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stack </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [(root_key, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [root_key])]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        node, acc, path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack.pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_depth:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            flags.append((</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"depth_exceeded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, path))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        holders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> edges.get(node, [])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> holders:                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 无上层股东 => 自然人终点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.startswith(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                results[node] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.get(node, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> holder, ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> holders:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> holder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path:                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 环形持股</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                flags.append((</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [holder]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            stack.append((holder, acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio, path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [holder]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ubos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {p: w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p, w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.items() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ubos, results, flags</span></span></code></pre></div><p>返回值刻意分成三份：达阈值的 UBO 集合、<strong>全部</strong>自然人的权益明细、以及结构性异常标记。第二份是为了让&quot;接近阈值但未达标&quot;的人（例如 20%）也能进入档案供后续比照——当持股结构发生小幅变动时，这批人可能直接跨过阈值。第三份是给人工复核与规则调优用的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与登记材料的对齐\">与登记材料的对齐</h3><p>官方登记与商家自述的持股数据经常对不上。处理方法不是二选一，而是<strong>把差异本身作为判定输入</strong>：如果商家自述的股权结构与登记机关的重要控制人登记不一致，且差异不能由&quot;登记滞后于实际&quot;解释，这就是一个需要解释的红旗。第 2 篇 <a href=\"legal-rep-id-nominee-detect\">法人身份核验与代持/挂名识别</a> 会把这类不一致与代持特征合并判定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>可信度</th>\n<th>更新时延</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>官方受益所有权登记（如 PSC 登记）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（依赖申报）</td>\n<td>仅覆盖登记要求范围内的关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LEI Level 2 关系数据</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>只表达会计并表母公司，非全部持股</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>登记机关的股东名册/年报</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高（年度申报）</td>\n<td>粒度粗、时点滞后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信用报告机构</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>覆盖率随国家差异大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家自行提交的股权结构图</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>未经验证，需交叉核对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LEI 的 Level 2 数据需要特别注意其语义：它只表达两级会计并表母公司（<strong>直接会计并表母公司</strong>与<strong>最终会计并表母公司</strong>），不是完整的持股链条。用它当穿透的输入时，缺失的中间层必须从别处补齐，不能把&quot;LEI 没记录&quot;当作&quot;没有上层股东&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.gleif.org/en/lei-data/access-and-use-lei-data/level-2-data-who-owns-whom\">GLEIF Level 2</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控权人识别的兜底路径\">控权人识别的兜底路径</h2><h3 id=\"为什么不能只靠-25\">为什么不能只靠 25%</h3><p>只按持股比例筛人，会系统性漏掉三类实际控制者：<strong>通过协议控制的人</strong>（一致行动协议、代持协议）、<strong>通过特殊表决权控制的人</strong>（双层股权、一票否决权）、以及<strong>通过任命权控制的人</strong>（有权任命或罢免多数董事）。这三类都不体现在持股比例上，却完全符合&quot;最终有效控制&quot;的实质。</p>\n<h3 id=\"兜底条件的结构化\">兜底条件的结构化</h3><p>把定性条件做成可判定的结构，关键是<strong>为每条条件指定可观测的证据</strong>，而不是让它停留在自由文本里：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;control_basis&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;ownership&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;effective_ratio&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 0.54, &quot;threshold&quot;: 0.25 },&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;voting_rights&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;voting_ratio&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 0.31, &quot;threshold&quot;: 0.25 },&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;appointment&quot;, &quot;evidence&quot;: &quot;articles_of_association_clause_12.3&quot;, &quot;detail&quot;: &quot;有权任命或罢免多数董事&quot; },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;other_control&quot;,&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: &quot;shareholder_agreement_2024&quot;,&#10;      &quot;detail&quot;: &quot;一致行动协议约定表决权委托&quot;,&#10;      &quot;review&quot;: &quot;manual&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;decision&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;ubos&quot;: [&quot;person:P1&quot;, &quot;person:P4&quot;],&#10;    &quot;by_ownership&quot;: [&quot;person:P1&quot;],&#10;    &quot;by_control&quot;: [&quot;person:P4&quot;],&#10;    &quot;near_threshold&quot;: { &quot;person:P2&quot;: 0.06, &quot;person:P3&quot;: 0.105 }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"control_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ownership\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"effective_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.54</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"voting_rights\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"voting_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"appointment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"articles_of_association_clause_12.3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"detail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"有权任命或罢免多数董事\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"other_control\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shareholder_agreement_2024\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"detail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"一致行动协议约定表决权委托\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"manual\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ubos\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person:P1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person:P4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"by_ownership\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person:P1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"by_control\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person:P4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"near_threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"person:P2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.06</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"person:P3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.105</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把控制依据做成带 <code>type</code> 的枚举而不是一段说明文字，带来两个实际好处：判定规则可以按 <code>type</code> 分别设阈值和证据要求；后续在 <a href=\"ubo-sanctions-aml-interface\">UBO 与制裁/AML 筛查接口</a> 里外送筛查时，可以按控制类型区分风险权重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与制裁规则的阈值差异\">与制裁规则的阈值差异</h3><p>需要特别指出：<strong>受益所有人阈值与制裁所有权规则是两个不同的阈值</strong>，混用会造成严重误判。OFAC 的 50% 规则规定，一个实体被一个或多个被制裁主体<strong>合计拥有 50% 或以上</strong>时即被冻结，且该规则<strong>只谈所有权、不谈控制</strong>；通过中间实体的间接所有权在被这些中间实体自身也被 50% 以上持有之时才计入（<a href=\"https://ofac.treasury.gov/faqs/topic/1521\">OFAC 50 Percent Rule</a>）。</p>\n<p>这两个数字（25% 用于尽调识别，50% 用于制裁自动冻结）服务于不同目的，在系统里必须是两个独立可配置的常量，而不是一个&quot;阈值&quot;参数被两处复用。25% 的事在 <a href=\"ubo-sanctions-aml-interface\">UBO 与制裁/AML 筛查接口</a> 消费，50% 的判定属于制裁筛查引擎侧的职责边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"穿透结果的存储与复算\">穿透结果的存储与复算</h2><h3 id=\"图模型\">图模型</h3><p>持股关系天然是图，用邻接表建模即可，不必上专门的图数据库——除非规模大到需要图算法库。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE ownership_edge (&#10;  edge_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  holder_key     TEXT NOT NULL,      -- 自然人 &#39;person:*&#39; 或法人主键&#10;  subject_key    TEXT NOT NULL,      -- 被持股主体&#10;  ratio_ownership NUMERIC(7,6) NOT NULL CHECK (ratio_ownership BETWEEN 0 AND 1),&#10;  ratio_voting   NUMERIC(7,6) CHECK (ratio_voting BETWEEN 0 AND 1),&#10;  basis          TEXT NOT NULL,      -- &#39;registry&#39; | &#39;annual-return&#39; | &#39;merchant-declared&#39; | &#39;lei-l2&#39;&#10;  effective_from DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   DATE,&#10;  source_ref     TEXT&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX ON ownership_edge (subject_key, effective_from DESC);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON ownership_edge (holder_key);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE ubo_resolution (&#10;  resolution_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  legal_entity_key TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  person_key     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_ratio NUMERIC(7,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  basis_types    TEXT[] NOT NULL,     -- {&#39;ownership&#39;,&#39;voting_rights&#39;,&#39;appointment&#39;}&#10;  method         TEXT NOT NULL,       -- &#39;graph&#39; | &#39;manual&#39;&#10;  as_of          TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  graph_snapshot_ref TEXT NOT NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ownership_edge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  edge_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  holder_key     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 自然人 'person:*' 或法人主键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_key    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 被持股主体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ratio_ownership </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ratio_ownership </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ratio_voting   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ratio_voting </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  basis          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'registry' | 'annual-return' | 'merchant-declared' | 'lei-l2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ownership_edge (subject_key, effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ownership_edge (holder_key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ubo_resolution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolution_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_entity_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  person_key     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  basis_types    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {'ownership','voting_rights','appointment'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  method         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'graph' | 'manual'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  as_of          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  graph_snapshot_ref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ownership_edge</code> 带 <code>effective_from</code>/<code>effective_to</code> 是必须的：持股会变，判定必须能回答&quot;在 2026 年 3 月那个时点，UBO 是谁&quot;。这在事后审计、纠纷举证、执法配合时都是刚需。<code>graph_snapshot_ref</code> 指向那次判定所用的图版本，保证结论可复现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"何时重算\">何时重算</h3><p>UBO 结果不能只在入驻时算一次。触发重算的条件包括：任何与本主体相关的持股边发生增删改、主体本身被上层收购、阈值配置变更（监管调整）、以及 <a href=\"../kyb-monitoring-lifecycle/ongoing-monitoring-change-rescreen\">持续监控</a> 检测到的登记变更。重算后 UBO 集合的<strong>差集</strong>是关键输出：新增的 UBO 必须立刻补做身份核验与筛查，移除的 UBO 则标记为历史关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>UBO 是<strong>最终</strong>拥有或控制法人实体的<strong>自然人</strong>；25% 是各国实践中通行的数值阈值，但每个司法管辖区的措辞与附加条件不同（英国为超过 25%，加拿大为至少 25%，阿联酋为 25% 加任命权），系统必须按司法管辖区可配置。</li>\n<li>权益计算是<strong>沿路径相乘、跨路径相加</strong>；最常见的实现错误是逐层取最大值，会让多路径合计持股的自然人被系统性漏掉。</li>\n<li>图遍历必须处理<strong>环形持股</strong>（访问标记）与<strong>深度上限</strong>（显式熔断而非静默返回），&quot;穿不到底&quot;应当是一个显式失败。</li>\n<li>只靠 25% 会漏掉协议控制、特殊表决权、任命权三类实际控制者；控制依据应做成带 <code>type</code> 的结构化枚举，每条都绑定可观测证据。</li>\n<li><strong>25%（尽调识别）与 50%（OFAC 冻结规则）是两个独立阈值</strong>，绝不可复用同一参数；穿透结果需按时间点可复现地存储，持股边变更即触发重算与 UBO 差集处理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"UBO 25% 穿透与控权人识别","id":"ubo-25-穿透与控权人识别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"权益的递归计算","id":"权益的递归计算"},{"level":3,"text":"乘法沿路径、加法跨路径","id":"乘法沿路径-加法跨路径"},{"level":3,"text":"环形持股与截断","id":"环形持股与截断"},{"level":3,"text":"与登记材料的对齐","id":"与登记材料的对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"控权人识别的兜底路径","id":"控权人识别的兜底路径"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能只靠 25%","id":"为什么不能只靠-25"},{"level":3,"text":"兜底条件的结构化","id":"兜底条件的结构化"},{"level":3,"text":"与制裁规则的阈值差异","id":"与制裁规则的阈值差异"},{"level":2,"text":"穿透结果的存储与复算","id":"穿透结果的存储与复算"},{"level":3,"text":"图模型","id":"图模型"},{"level":3,"text":"何时重算","id":"何时重算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"经营地址/实际场所核验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/business-identity-verification/operating-address-presence-check"},"next":{"title":"法人身份核验与代持/挂名识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/ubo-controller-due-diligence/legal-rep-id-nominee-detect"}}